  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Ht.JoinFacts.main | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Ht.JoinFacts.main | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Ht.JoinFacts.main <;> assumption)
